# Bot1 Bolts Bot2's face first, so Bot2 "lost life this turn" (CR 119.3) when Thought-Stalker Warlock's enters trigger resolves:
# Bot2 reveals its hand (Lightning Bolt, Llanowar Elves, four Forests) and Bot1 - not Bot2 - chooses a nonland card from it.
# A Forest is not offered (`! Bot1.Choose(Forest)`); the positive control is Lightning Bolt, chosen on the next line. Bot2 keeps
# its Forests and Elves, so the "otherwise" half (Bot2's own choice) did not happen.

